---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Saint-Paul-Émard"
  description="Saint-Paul-Émard — first active DeadMTL sector. Fractured enclave, canal edge, winter 1993–1994. Not safe. Not fully lost."
>

<div class="page-bbs-bar" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="pbb__seg pbb__seg--active">Sector Dossier</span>
  <span class="pbb__seg">Saint-Paul-Émard</span>
  <span class="pbb__seg pbb__seg--sys">Sector 01 — Active</span>
  <span class="pbb__spacer"></span>
  <span class="pbb__ref">MTL SOUTH-WEST // WINTER 93/94</span>
</div>

<div class="bbs-block" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="bbs__line bbs__line--header">DOSSIER: SAINT-PAUL-ÉMARD &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; SECTOR 01 &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ACTIVE ENCLAVE &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; LASALLE PRESSURE NORTH</div>
  <div class="bbs__line bbs__line--system">CLASSIFICATION: MVP ZONE &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ACCESS: READ-ONLY &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; WINTER 1993&ndash;1994</div>
  <div class="bbs__line bbs__line--warn">WARNING: NOT SAFE &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; NOT FULLY LOST &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; ENTRY POINT &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; WHITELIST CLOSED</div>
</div>

<section class="term-hero" style="padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);">
  <div class="th__inner hero-split">

    <div>
      <div class="th__eyebrow">SECTOR 01 // ACTIVE ENCLAVE // WINTER 1993&ndash;1994</div>
      <div class="th__headline" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);">Saint-Paul-Émard</div>
      <div class="th__sub" style="font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);">
        First enclosed sector of DeadMTL.
      </div>
      <p class="th__body">
        Montréal is dead by pieces. Saint-Paul-Émard is the first piece still
        manageable enough to map. It combines Ville-Émard and
        Côte-Saint-Paul into a single DeadMTL sector identity.
        Not safe. Not fully lost. The entry point.
      </p>
      <div class="th__cta">
        <a href="/"          class="term-btn term-btn--ghost">&larr; Home</a>
        <a href="/dispatch/" class="term-btn term-btn--teal">Dispatch &rsaquo;</a>
        <a href="/map/"      class="term-btn term-btn--ghost">Regional Map &rsaquo;</a>
        <a href="/construction/" class="term-btn term-btn--ghost">Season 0 Status &rsaquo;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div aria-hidden="true" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:1rem;">
      <div>
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.58rem; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:0.5rem;">SECTOR LOCATION</div>
        <div class="ascii-locator">
          <div class="al__grid">
            <div class="al__cell">STH</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--active">CSP</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--hot">JOL</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--active">CVL</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--loc">S-P-E</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--hot">LAS</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--active">CAN</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--active">VEM</div>
            <div class="al__cell al--hot">ANG</div>
          </div>
          <span class="al__caption">S-P-E &bull; 45°27'N 73°35'W</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-bar-list">
        {[
          { label: 'LaSalle',    pct: 78,  mod: 'crit' },
          { label: 'Jolicoeur',  pct: 52,  mod: 'hot'  },
          { label: 'P.Mercier',  pct: 100, mod: 'sealed'},
        ].map(z => (
          <div class="zone-bar">
            <span class="zb__label">{z.label}</span>
            <div class="zb__track">
              <div class={`zb__fill zb__fill--${z.mod}`} style={`width:${z.pct}%`}></div>
            </div>
            <span class={`zb__pct zb__pct--${z.mod}`}>{z.pct === 100 ? 'SEALED' : z.pct + '%'}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── SECTOR STATUS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow eyebrow--accent">Sector Dossier</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Status Overview</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Filed under active MVP zone. All data reflects current season conditions.</p>

    <div class="dossier-grid">
      <div class="dossier-stat dossier-stat--active"><div class="stat__label">Status</div><div class="stat__value">Active MVP Zone</div></div>
      <div class="dossier-stat"><div class="stat__label">Season</div><div class="stat__value">Winter 1993&ndash;1994</div></div>
      <div class="dossier-stat dossier-stat--warn"><div class="stat__label">Threat Level</div><div class="stat__value">Fragmented</div></div>
      <div class="dossier-stat"><div class="stat__label">Access</div><div class="stat__value">Quarantine Lines</div></div>
      <div class="dossier-stat"><div class="stat__label">Role</div><div class="stat__value">Entry Enclave</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="status-banner">
      <span class="banner__label">Quarantine</span>
      <span class="banner__text">
        Saint-Paul-Émard is the only open sector. All neighboring districts remain behind quarantine lines.
        Expansion follows evidence on the ground.
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── BOUNDARIES ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Perimeter</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Sector Boundaries</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">The playable square. What holds the enclave together and what presses against it.</p>

    <div class="boundary-grid">
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <span class="boundary__dir">North</span>
        <span class="boundary__desc">Canal de Lachine and the Saint-Patrick pressure corridor. Industrial banks, cold water, limited crossings. Saint-Henri visible on the far side.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <span class="boundary__dir">West</span>
        <span class="boundary__desc">Angrignon approach and the LaSalle line. Open ground feeds movement in from the south. The Mercier corridor bleeds pressure here continuously.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <span class="boundary__dir">South</span>
        <span class="boundary__desc">Canal de l'Aqueduc and the Verdun edge. Closed pockets. Civilian debris. Survivor-held blocks that do not welcome unknown arrivals.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <span class="boundary__dir">East</span>
        <span class="boundary__desc">Côte-Saint-Paul industrial corridors and autoroute structures. Rail lines, viaducts, high walls, dead-end approaches. Later route toward Pointe-Saint-Charles.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── INTERNAL SUBZONES ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Internal Structure</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Subzones</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Saint-Paul-Émard is not one thing. Four distinct subzones with different threat profiles.</p>

    <div class="subzone-grid">
      <div class="subzone-card subzone-card--medium">
        <div class="sub__name">Monk Residential</div>
        <p class="sub__desc">Duplexes, ruelles, corner shops, boarded windows, buried caches. Streets are navigable. Recoverable if approached carefully.</p>
        <span class="sub__threat">Threat: Medium — Recoverable</span>
      </div>
      <div class="subzone-card subzone-card--unstable">
        <div class="sub__name">Jolicoeur Barrier</div>
        <p class="sub__desc">Failed civilian triage. Buses as barricades. Improvised blockades that stopped nothing but blocked everything. Exits compromised.</p>
        <span class="sub__threat">Threat: Unstable — Active Cluster</span>
      </div>
      <div class="subzone-card subzone-card--high">
        <div class="sub__name">Canal Edge</div>
        <p class="sub__desc">Cold industrial strip along the waterline. Workshops, garages, fog off the canal. Useful loot. High risk. Unpredictable movement.</p>
        <span class="sub__threat">Threat: High — Industrial Corridor</span>
      </div>
      <div class="subzone-card subzone-card--mobile">
        <div class="sub__name">Angrignon Fringe</div>
        <p class="sub__desc">Open green buffer. Abandoned camps. Good sightlines, both ways. Migration flow from LaSalle brings mobile pressure.</p>
        <span class="sub__threat">Threat: Mobile — Unpredictable</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── NEIGHBOR PRESSURE ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">External Situation</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Neighboring Pressure Zones</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Districts that define the situation inside Saint-Paul-Émard without being accessible yet.</p>

    <div class="district-grid">
      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">LaSalle</div>
        <p class="card__desc">Mercier pressure. Bridge barricade failed in week one. Major horde source. Not an early zone.</p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--critical">Critical</span>
      </div>
      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">Verdun</div>
        <p class="card__desc">Closed pockets, survivor rationing, contested access. Smuggling routes active. Entry requires negotiation.</p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--contested">Contested</span>
      </div>
      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">Saint-Henri</div>
        <p class="card__desc">Canal crossings, workshops, industrial loot. The north bank is contested. Every crossing costs something.</p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--contested">Contested</span>
      </div>
      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">Pointe-Saint-Charles</div>
        <p class="card__desc">Rails and viaducts. Autoroute corridors. Later route toward central Montréal. Not yet reachable.</p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--tense">Tense</span>
      </div>
      <div class="district-card">
        <div class="card__name">Angrignon</div>
        <p class="card__desc">False calm. Open land, abandoned camps, moving dead. No anchored threat. Constant drift.</p>
        <span class="card__status card__status--buffer">Buffer</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── ACCESS GATES ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Perimeter Control</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Access Gates</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Designated crossing points. All currently restricted. Status reflects last confirmed field report, winter 1993&ndash;1994.</p>

    <div class="gate-list">
      <div class="gate-item"><span class="gate__id">Gate A</span><span class="gate__name">Monk North Crossing</span><span class="gate__status gate__status--locked">Locked</span></div>
      <div class="gate-item"><span class="gate__id">Gate B</span><span class="gate__name">Angrignon West Line</span><span class="gate__status gate__status--unstable">Unstable</span></div>
      <div class="gate-item"><span class="gate__id">Gate C</span><span class="gate__name">Aqueduct South Cut</span><span class="gate__status gate__status--watched">Watched</span></div>
      <div class="gate-item"><span class="gate__id">Gate D</span><span class="gate__name">Industrial East Corridor</span><span class="gate__status gate__status--blocked">Blocked</span></div>
      <div class="gate-item"><span class="gate__id">Gate E</span><span class="gate__name">Canal Service Route</span><span class="gate__status gate__status--limited">Limited</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── GAMEPLAY ROLE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="eyebrow">Server Design</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Gameplay Role</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">What Saint-Paul-Émard does in the server world. Not a tutorial. A district that happens to be survivable enough to start in.</p>

    <ul class="gameplay-list">
      <li>Starting district for all Season 0 players. Entry point into the server world.</li>
      <li>Early scavenging across Monk Residential and Canal Edge subzones.</li>
      <li>First contact with the Jolicoeur Barrier situation and its locked exits.</li>
      <li>First Dispatch events originate here before expanding outward.</li>
      <li>Faction rumors surface through player interactions and dispatch posts.</li>
      <li>Map expansion hooks: Saint-Henri canal crossings, Verdun smuggling, LaSalle pressure.</li>
      <li>Tutorial progression without tutorial framing. Learn by surviving, not by prompts.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── DISPATCH HOOKS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Incoming Signal</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Linked Transmissions</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">First dispatch entries filed from Saint-Paul-Émard. Read the full transmission for each event.</p>

    <div class="hook-grid">
      <a class="hook-card" href="/dispatch/signal-monk/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block;">
        <div class="hook__signal">&#x25A0; Signal Inbound</div>
        <div class="hook__title">Signal Monk</div>
        <p class="hook__desc">Something is broadcasting from deep inside the Monk Residential block. Short-range, irregular. Could be a survivor. Could be a looped recording. Could be bait.</p>
        <span class="hook__tag">Monk Residential &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="hook-card" href="/dispatch/canal-cache/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block;">
        <div class="hook__signal">&#x25A0; Cache Report</div>
        <div class="hook__title">The Canal Cache</div>
        <p class="hook__desc">A marked location along the Canal Edge subzone. Supplies left in a workshop near the waterline. The mark is visible. Whether the cache is still there is not confirmed.</p>
        <span class="hook__tag">Canal Edge &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="hook-card" href="/dispatch/lasalle-pressure-night/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block;">
        <div class="hook__signal">&#x25A0; Pressure Event</div>
        <div class="hook__title">The LaSalle Pressure Night</div>
        <p class="hook__desc">Movement from LaSalle peaked overnight on February 1st. The Angrignon Fringe absorbed the initial surge. The Jolicoeur line reported contact. Saint-Paul-Émard held.</p>
        <span class="hook__tag">Angrignon Fringe &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── CLOSING ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <blockquote style="border-left: 2px solid var(--oxblood); padding-left: 1.5rem;">
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-dim); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.75;">
        &ldquo;The enclave holds because the canal holds. If the canal line breaks,
        Saint-Paul-Émard is not a sector anymore. It is a corridor between two worse places.&rdquo;
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>
